    {
      "key": "APP-1",
      "type": "Epic",
      "summary": "Pack lists",
      "status": "In Progress",
      "priority": "High",
      "assignee": "s-yuki",
      "reporter": "s-priya",
      "parent": "",
      "labels": ["pack-lists"],
      "components": ["Pack lists"],
      "due": null,
      "points": null,
      "estimate": "",
      "remaining": "",
      "watchers": ["s-amara", "s-priya"],
      "created": "-30d 09:30",
      "description": [
        "## The problem",
        "",
        "In interviews, 9 of 12 hikers told us they pack from a list: a note on the phone, a spreadsheet, a photo of last year's paper list. Three said they forgot the same thing twice. Head torches, mostly.",
        "",
        "## The idea",
        "",
        "A pack list for every trip, started from a template, ticked off at home, with the weight adding up. What is missing can go straight into the cart.",
        "",
        "## Out of scope for 3.0",
        "",
        "- Sharing a list with friends ([[APP-12]])",
        "- Lists without signal ([[APP-4]])",
        "",
        "Requirements: [[page:PROD/Pack lists]]"
      ],
      "history": [
        {"at": "-28d 09:00", "by": "s-yuki", "field": "status", "from": "To Do", "to": "In Progress"}
      ],
      "links": [],
      "comments": [
        {
          "by": "s-tomasz",
          "at": "-29d 10:00",
          "body": "One question before we start: are lists stored on the phone or in summit? I would like summit, so a list survives a new phone."
        },
        {
          "by": "s-yuki",
          "at": "-29d 10:40",
          "body": "summit, with a copy on the phone for reading. Writing without signal comes with the offline epic."
        },
        {
          "by": "s-priya",
          "at": "-2d 17:00",
          "body": "Beta testers created 214 lists in two weeks. The most used template is the hut trip, the least used is winter camping, which is fair for October."
        }
      ]
    },
